Error [E0770]: Two parameters both publish the label `at`
  --> tests/ui/param_label_duplicate.jet:1:28
    |
  1 | fn schedule(at first: Int, at second: Int) Int -> first + second
    |                            ^^
 Why: A label binds an argument by name, so a repeated one leaves the second parameter with no way to be called
 Fix: Give one of them a different label, as in `at_2 second: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0770
